{"id":71223,"date":"2026-10-28T13:28:42","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T13:28:42","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71223"},"modified":"2026-10-28T14:30:43","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T13:30:43","slug":"trail-vale-encantado","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-vale-encantado\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Vale Encantado \u2013 ARCVC 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do Vale Encantado \u2013 ARCVC 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail do Vale Encantado \u2013 ARCVC 2027<\/strong> (4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail ARC Vale S\u00e3o Cosme) realiza-se no domingo, dia <strong>14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, com centro nevr\u00e1lgico, partidas e chegadas junto ao <strong>CIIES de Vale S\u00e3o Cosme<\/strong> (antiga escola Did\u00e1xis), no concelho de <strong>Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>. Integrada no <strong>Campeonato Concelhio de Trail de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong>, esta prova desafia-te a explorar as encostas florestais do Vale de S\u00e3o Cosme ao longo de uma manh\u00e3 de puro trail running no cora\u00e7\u00e3o do Minho.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo adapta-se a diferentes n\u00edveis de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o: o exigente <strong>Trail Longo de 27 km<\/strong> (1250 m D+), o r\u00e1pido <strong>Trail Curto \/ Sprint de 17 km<\/strong> (675 m D+), o <strong>Mini Trail de 7 km<\/strong> (200 m D+), a <strong>Caminhada de 7 km<\/strong> e o <strong>Trail Kids (~700 m)<\/strong> para os mais jovens. Os percursos serpenteiam por manchas de floresta aut\u00f3ctone, eucaliptais, <em>singletracks<\/em> t\u00e9cnicos e zonas de patrim\u00f3nio arqueol\u00f3gico marcadas pelo granito minhoto, oferecendo vistas panor\u00e2micas privilegiadas sobre o <strong>Vale do Pelhe<\/strong> e os cumes envolventes de Famalic\u00e3o.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa e Cultural de Vale S\u00e3o Cosme (ARCVC)<\/strong>, o evento garante cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, seguro desportivo, postos de abastecimento (em regime de eco-responsabilidade, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio levares o teu copo ou reservat\u00f3rio), pr\u00e9mio <em>finisher<\/em>, senha de refor\u00e7o alimentar na meta e banhos nos balne\u00e1rios do Pavilh\u00e3o CIIES Vale S\u00e3o Cosme, situados a apenas 50 metros da chegada. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">CIIES de Vale S\u00e3o Cosme (Antiga Escola Did\u00e1xis), Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o, Braga<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-