: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 11,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 25\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 13,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 07\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Kids<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:30<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail do Vale Encantado \u2013 ARCVC 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail do Vale Encantado \u2013 ARCVC 2027 realiza-se no domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partidas e chegadas no CIIES de Vale S\u00e3o Cosme (antiga Escola Did\u00e1xis, GPS: N 41.44062\u00ba, W 8.47756\u00ba), em Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o, distrito de Braga. Segundo o regulamento oficial, as partidas decorrem \u00e0s 09:00 (Trail Longo 27 km), 09:30 (Trail Curto 17 km), 09:45 (Mini Trail e Caminhada 7 km) e 11:30 (Trail Kids).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e tempos limite da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento integra cinco formatos: Trail Longo de 27 km (1250 m D+, idade m\u00ednima 20 anos, tempo limite de 4h30m com barreira hor\u00e1ria \u00e0s 12:00 ao km 16), Trail Curto\/Sprint de 17 km (675 m D+, idade m\u00ednima 18 anos, tempo limite de 3h30m), Mini Trail de 7 km (200 m D+, idade m\u00ednima 16 anos), Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 7 km (~200 m D+, aberta a todas as idades) e Trail Kids (~700 m).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos das fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 divididas em 3 fases: at\u00e9 25 de dezembro de 2026 custam 17,50 \u20ac (Trail Longo 27 km), 12,50 \u20ac (Trail Curto 17 km) e 11,00 \u20ac (Mini Trail \/ Caminhada 7 km); de 26 de dezembro a 31 de janeiro de 2027 passam para 20,00 \u20ac, 15,00 \u20ac e 13,00 \u20ac; e de 1 de fevereiro a 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 fixam-se em 25,00 \u20ac, 17,50 \u20ac e 15,00 \u20ac, respetivamente.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que material \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio levar e que servi\u00e7os inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Por motivos ambientais, \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio levares copo ou reservat\u00f3rio pr\u00f3prio de \u00e1gua para os abastecimentos, sendo ainda recomendado telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito e manta t\u00e9rmica (sujeitos a verifica\u00e7\u00e3o aleat\u00f3ria). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos, brindes, pr\u00e9mio finisher e senha de refor\u00e7o final nas provas de trail, al\u00e9m de duches nos balne\u00e1rios do Pavilh\u00e3o CIIES a 50 metros da meta.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o hor\u00e1rio de funcionamento do secretariado e quem organiza a prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa e Cultural de Vale S\u00e3o Cosme (ARCVC) e pontua para o Campeonato Concelhio de Trail de Famalic\u00e3o. O levantamento de dorsais decorre no CIIES de Vale S\u00e3o Cosme no s\u00e1bado, 13 de mar\u00e7o, das 14:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o, das 07:00 \u00e0s 08:45.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail do Vale Encantado \u2013 ARCVC 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"endDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"CIIES de Vale S\u00e3o Cosme (Antiga Escola Did\u00e1xis), Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail do Vale Encantado \u2013 ARCVC 2027 realiza-se a 14 de mar\u00e7o em Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o. Trail de 27 km, 17 km, 7 km e caminhada. Garante j\u00e1 a tua inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-vale-encantado.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo\", \"price\": \"17.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/565\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto (Sprint)\", \"price\": \"12.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctim